    #          its line;
    #       P3 a root binding all five prefixes, holding two dc:title: the
    #          two-elements message, raised by the properties read;
    #       P4 the same root holding one dc:title, the control for P3: exit 0,
    #          its line.
    # (T) --protect-sample, the template's worksheet children after its empty
